## **Ejemplo Completo: Crear Partida**

### 1. Usuario pide jugar
```
[frontend] ──HTTP POST──> [matchmaking-service]
           "Quiero jugar"
```

matchmaking-service **ESCUCHA** en `POST /queue/join`

### 2. Matchmaking encuentra oponente
```
[matchmaking] ──Redis PUBLISH──> Canal "match:created"
              {players: ["alice", "bob"]}
```

matchmaking-service **EMITE** evento a Redis

### 3. Game-service se entera
```
[game-service] ──Redis SUBSCRIBE── Canal "match:created"
               (estaba escuchando)
```

game-service **ESCUCHA** canal de Redis

### 4. Game-service crea partida
```
[game-service] ──HTTP POST──> [database]
               {matchId, players, status}
```

game-service **EMITE** petición HTTP a database

### 5. Database guarda y responde
```
[database] ──HTTP 200──> [game-service]
           {match: {...}}
```

database **ESCUCHA** en `POST /matches` y **EMITE** respuesta

### 6. Game-service notifica jugadores
```
[game-service] ──WebSocket EMIT──> [frontend-alice]
               ──WebSocket EMIT──> [frontend-bob]
               "game:start"
```

game-service **EMITE** por WebSocket a ambos clientes

